@host = http://localhost:5129
@jane = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@arjun = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@david = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@sarah = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Seeded demo users (no header needed)
GET {{host}}/api/users

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/api/users/me
X-User-Id: {{jane}}

### Claimant submits a claim -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/claims
X-User-Id: {{jane}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimType": "Motor",
  "description": "Rear-ended while stopped at a traffic light.",
  "incidentLocation": "Orchard Road, Singapore",
  "incidentDate": "2026-11-20T09:30:00+08:00",
  "claimedAmount": 4500.50,
  "marketCode": "SG"
}

### Invalid payload -> 400 with field errors
POST {{host}}/api/claims
X-User-Id: {{jane}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimType": "Property",
  "description": "Pipe burst in kitchen.",
  "incidentLocation": "Kuala Lumpur",
  "incidentDate": "2099-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "claimedAmount": 1.234,
  "marketCode": "US"
}

### Officer tries to submit -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/claims
X-User-Id: {{david}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimType": "Property",
  "description": "Pipe burst in kitchen.",
  "incidentLocation": "Kuala Lumpur",
  "incidentDate": "2026-11-01T00:00:00Z",
  "claimedAmount": 100,
  "marketCode": "MY"
}

### Claimant's own claims (newest first)
GET {{host}}/api/claims
X-User-Id: {{jane}}

### Another claimant sees none of Jane's claims
GET {{host}}/api/claims
X-User-Id: {{arjun}}

### Officer work queue: unassigned, submitted, Singapore (oldest first)
GET {{host}}/api/claims?assignment=Unassigned&status=Submitted&marketCode=SG
X-User-Id: {{david}}

### Claim detail (replace the id with one returned above)
GET {{host}}/api/claims/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-User-Id: {{david}}

### No header -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/claims
